<title>USA: Bowater completes Star Forms sale.</title>
<headline>Bowater completes Star Forms sale.</headline>
<dateline>GREENVILLE, S.C. 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bowater Inc said on Friday that it has completed the previously announced sale of its Star Forms Inc unit to  CST Office Products Inc for $80 million.</p>
</text>
